  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting community-led crisis response (sclr) project in Ukraine&#x202f;- 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This intervention will be a continuation of the previous Act CoS sclr project, &#x200b;which&#x200b;&#x200b; aims &#x200b;for people affected by crises to &#x200b;meet the&#x200b;ir priorities by investing in a locally-led process that provides communities with greater control to make decisions about their own response, recovery and resilience&#x200b;&#x200b;&#x200b;&#x200b;&#x200b;&#x200b;&#x200b;&#x200b;. This will be done by organising and supporting at least 43 community groups who will design and implement 53 sclr micro-grant initiatives to reach&#x200b; &#x200b;the needs of 2,600&#x200b;&#x200b;&#x200b;&#x200b;&#x200b; vulnerable individuals.</narrative>
  </description>
